    {
      "id": "claim_2bbc0a8ce9dd44e6ad3ac7f9fa7bb5a9",
      "statement": "capture_screenshot scope is intentionally viewport-only per ADR 0064: full-page scroll-stitch, annotation/highlighting, screencast/video, policy redaction, and background-tab capture are all out of scope and deferred to P4.5 (Visual Evidence). Screenshots are explicit only with no auto-capture or continuous streaming, consistent with Brijio's privacy-by-design model.",
