      "id": "claim_eadfc1497622412995412d0c74289b4a",
      "statement": "list_tabs returns every open tab in the connected browser including background tabs, as TabInfo entries (tabId string, windowId, title, url, active, supported). Only HTTP/HTTPS tabs are listed: the extension filters with isRegularPageUrl before returning, excluding chrome:// and about: tabs. If the extension provides no TabListerAdapter, the controller responds with not_supported. Both Chrome and Safari ship a tabLister adapter built on tabs.query({}).",
